   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Tenant isolation: creds never cross tenants\n\u2022 Respect provider rate limits (429 backoff)\n\u2022 Normalise results to a common schema\n\u2022 In-VPC relay for private clusters\n\u2022 Timeouts + partial results\n\u2022 Audit log of every query",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Tenant isolation: creds never cross tenants\n\u2022 Respect provider rate limits (429 backoff)\n\u2022 Normalise results to a common schema\n\u2022 In-VPC relay for private clusters\n\u2022 Timeouts + partial results\n\u2022 Audit log of every query",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
